edby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T19:26:51-08:00","id":1015098,"title":"","content":"True. Also, i would think that Henderson kinda helps make more Hollowed due to the fact that cosmetics could cause extreme envy. Also, do you think these guys could make great villains for the game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T19:33:02-08:00","id":1015100,"title":"","content":"I'd say they would be the greatest threat to Soucouyants as a whole...or rather, the greatest threat outside of their own society.<br /> <br /> Henderson would be doing what every other company of its type would be doing, but I think they'd pump more out knowing full well the factors behind the birth of a Hollow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T19:52:02-08:00","id":1015112,"title":"","content":"Even more threatening than the Loa servants? Also, one of their weapons is a shot-gun filled with rock salt. They also think the Hollowing could make a great plastic surgery tool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"ke