uld write their backstory . Also, Claude would be 117 years old. Also, do you have any plot hooks for these guys yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T20:23:43-08:00","id":1015137,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking about them...yet I'm running to a dead end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-09T20:26:30-08:00","id":1015140,"title":"","content":"I think their backstory should have Claude witness a Hollowing of one of his employees. Also, his company was founder in 1929.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T07:45:33-08:00","id":1015250,"title":"","content":"I would think that Henderson would be a International corporation. Also, I have no idea how Claude would convince employees to fight literal orbs of fire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T09:07:07-08:00","id":1015260,"title":"","content":"Well, perhaps its an inner circle sort of thing, only those with certain skills, knowledges and powers are sent to deal with Soucouyants...namely rogue Mages and other powerful humans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T09:27:38-08:00","id":1015265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Irontsim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1014449-socouyant-the-hollowing-a-fangame-in-the-works?p=1015260#post1015260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, perhaps its an inner circle sort of thing, only those with certain skills, knowledges and powers are sent to deal with Soucouyants...namely rogue Mages and other powerful humans.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bEither that or it's a squad-like thing like Pentex first teams, but instead of formori induced soldiers they hire out mercenaries. Also, Henderson's corporate hq is either in South Africa or in Argentina.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T09:33:18-08:00","id":1015270,"title":"","content":"Anywhere they can get away with flagrant human rights abuses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T09:36:54-08:00","id":1015272,"title":"","content":"What human rights abuses? Also, does the mercenary part okay? Also, one illustration with them could be a gallery in a mall showing off all of their products.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T09:43:39-08:00","id":1015273,"title":"","content":"I'd suspect that, given what they do, I'd suspect that a number of their products aren't exactly cruelty-free. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As for the mercenaries, makes sense...expendable assets and all that jazz.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T09:49:13-08:00","id":1015275,"title":"","content":"Claude himself uses the plastic surgery the company uses to hide his real age. However, his body keeps ageing rapidly. Another thing, if these guys could appear in another game line in Chronicles of Darkness, which one do you think they could fit in?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T09:55:22-08:00","id":1015277,"title":"","content":"My guess is that they'd also have run-ins with the Kindred, what them also being a potential prospect for Henderson to gain immortality...they'd just need to iron out the Vampire flaws. Given their experiments, I think they'd attract the attention of the Uratha...especially when they abduct a a Wolf-Blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:02:02-08:00","id":1015280,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Irontsim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1014449-socouyant-the-hollowing-a-fangame-in-the-works?p=1015277#post1015277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My guess is that they'd also have run-ins with the Kindred, what them also being a potential prospect for Henderson to gain immortality...they'd just need to iron out the Vampire flaws. Given their experiments, I think they'd attract the attention of the Uratha...especially when they abduct a a Wolf-Blood.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bOkay. I will try to write their history soon. Also, who would've guessed that a company that makes make-up would be so evil?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:10:27-08:00","id":1015282,"title":"","content":"Money and vanity are but two of the things that can turn people into monsters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:12:35-08:00","id":1015284,"title":"","content":"Would you call Claude Henderson vain or envious? Also, the company was founded in South Africa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:20:56-08:00","id":1015288,"title":"","content":"I'd say both, narcissism can lead a person to hold those two personality traits...and down a very dark path.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:26:46-08:00","id":1015290,"title":"","content":"I am just picturing a hollowed female using the company's makeup, not realizing what they would do if they capture her. Also, just picture how these guys would fair in a average Socouyant chronicle.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:37:45-08:00","id":1015298,"title":"","content":"Depends...really old Soucouyants are powerful, but the ones that have been recently marked or have a few years on them tend to have a few powers but are nowhere near as experienced in surviving those who actively hunt them. Indeed, they are far too used to dealing with each other, never realising that a group of humans are actively seeking them out...unless they've had run-ins in the past. A lot of things could indeed happen.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","name":"Irontsim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11607_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:45:52-08:00","id":1015300,"title":"","content":"Alright. Also, this is the opening sentences of Henderson's history.<br /> <br /> \u200bHenderson Cosmetics, when one hears of this company they picture sking grafts, make-up,and plastic surgery. But, to a Hollowed they mean one thing, danger. Based in Cape Town, South Africa, Henderson seeks out the Soucouyants\u200b for the sole purpose of fulfilling the goals of their CEO and founder, Claude Henderson.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-10T10:49:57-08:00","id":1015302,"title":"","content":"So far, so good. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11607-irontsim","nam